Table~\ref{tab:paired-ablation} applies the same paired comparison to the two ablations against the external alternatives.
Across the \PairedSeparationMeasureCount\ WritingBench and HelloBench native and pointwise contrasts with the three alternatives, the interval excludes zero for \PairedSeparatedFull\ with \condAgenticCogWriter, \PairedSeparatedNoGoals\ with \condNoGoals, and \PairedSeparatedFixedOrder\ with \condFixedOrder.
